  "text": "## Control Framework  \n**Three Lines of Defense:**  \n**Line 1: Frontline Management**\n- Department heads responsible for risk\n- Operating procedures\n- Daily monitoring\n- Immediate incident response  \n**Line 2: Risk & Compliance**\n- Risk policy and framework\n- Independent risk monitoring\n- Control testing\n- Escalation procedures  \n**Line 3: Internal Audit**\n- Independent assurance\n- Control testing\n- Audit reports\n- Follow-up verification  \n---",
